The Claude Frontier Academy’s FDE Residency enables us to scale a discipline we’ve already tested in the field, which is why we are excited to be part of the inaugural cohort, bringing our engineers in early to extend our bench of Claude-ready talent.”Faruk Muratovic Principal, Deloitte Consulting LLP. End quote.

